From: Your Name <your.email@example.com>
Date: Fri, 21 May 2026 00:00:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Add autofocus button and auto-detect active camera for snapshot

This patch adds:
- A new button to trigger single-shot autofocus
- Auto-detection of the V4L2 device currently used by gnome-snapshot
- Support for setting auto-exposure mode

The window now automatically switches to the camera that gnome-snapshot is
using, eliminating the need for manual device selection.
